# Hash64ReferenceVectors.json is the determinism pin (14 §8.0) and is re-asserted on
# Linux x64, Android ARM64 and iOS ARM64 by the cross-platform job (M5-12). Its line
# endings are pinned to LF so the file is byte-identical on every one of them, and so a
# one-row addition never diffs as a whole-file rewrite because someone's core.autocrlf
# disagreed. It follows the same rule as SlayIdleRepeat.Data/.
*.json text eol=lf
